   "rows": [
    {
     "index": 0,
     "category": "paraphrase",
     "text": "Why this company?",
     "is_question": true,
     "addressee": "me",
     "bank_id": "b002",
     "warmup": false,
     "turn_ids": [
      "r1"
     ],
     "heard": "Why this company",
     "detected_answerable": true,
     "detected_kind": [
      "question"
     ],
     "heard_addressee": [
      "unknown"
     ],
     "say_lines": 1,
     "suggestion_lines": [
      {
       "call": "f0001",
       "line": "SAY: What stands out to me is the direction the product is taking.",
       "turn_id": "r1"
      },
      {
       "call": "f0001",
       "line": "- The company is moving from rules-based dispatch to an LLM-assisted dispatcher, with a pilot planned for Q1 2027.",
       "turn_id": "r1"
      },
      {
       "call": "f0001",
       "line": "- I have built LLM pipelines: I led Lantern, which extracts structured fields from supplier invoices.",
       "turn_id": "r1"
      },
      {
       "call": "d0002",
       "line": "- Halden builds route-planning software for mid-size European haulage firms, which is the domain where my courier route optimiser work applies directly. (f004, f019)",
       "turn_id": "r1"
      },
      {
       "call": "d0002",
       "line": "- Compass re-plans delivery routes every 90 seconds, and moving beyond rules-based dispatch to an LLM-assisted dispatcher, with a Q1 2027 pilot, is the part I most want to work on. (f007, g004)",
       "turn_id": "r1"
      },
      {
       "call": "d0002",
       "line": "- I led Lantern, an LLM pipeline that cut manual data entry from 11 minutes to 2 minutes per invoice, so I can contribute to the dispatcher from day one. (f010, f006)",
       "turn_id": "r1"
      },
      {
       "call": "d0002",
       "line": "- I'd join a 6-person AI team reporting to Ingrid at a company of about 140 people, where I can have direct impact. (f008, f009)",
       "turn_id": "r1"
      }
     ],
     "main_turn": "r1",
     "asr_endpoint_s": 0.696,
     "sf_tier": "F",
     "sf_first_text_s": 1.497,
     "d_first_text_s": 1.92
    },
    {
     "index": 2,
     "category": "paraphrase",
     "text": "What's your weakness?",
     "is_question": true,
     "addressee": "me",
     "bank_id": "b005",
     "warmup": false,
     "turn_ids": [
      "r2"
     ],
     "heard": "What's your weakness?",
     "detected_answerable": true,
     "detected_kind": [
      "question"
     ],
     "heard_addressee": [
      "me"
     ],
     "say_lines": 1,
     "suggestion_lines": [
      {
       "call": "d0004",
       "line": "- I used to over-engineer early prototypes, building too much before checking the idea worked. (b005)",
       "turn_id": "r2"
      },
      {
       "call": "d0004",
       "line": "- The fix is to ship a thin working version in the first week and get feedback early. (b005, b020)",
       "turn_id": "r2"
      },
      {
       "call": "d0004",
       "line": "- It's a habit I deliberately changed, so I now start small and expand only where it proves useful. (b020)",
       "turn_id": "r2"
      },
      {
       "call": "f0003",
       "line": "SAY: One I've actively worked on is how I approach early prototypes.",
       "turn_id": "r2"
      },
      {
       "call": "f0003",
       "line": "- I used to over-engineer early prototypes.",
       "turn_id": "r2"
      },
      {
       "call": "f0003",
       "line": "- Now I ship a thin version in the first week.",
       "turn_id": "r2"
      }
     ],
     "main_turn": "r2",
     "asr_endpoint_s": 0.378,
     "sf_tier": "F",
     "sf_first_text_s": 1.846,
     "d_first_text_s": 1.669
    },
    {
     "index": 4,
     "category": "paraphrase",
     "text": "Describe Lantern.",
