     "say_lines": 1,
     "suggestion_lines": [
      {
       "call": "f0005",
       "line": "SAY: Happy to; it's the project I can speak about in the most detail.",
       "turn_id": "r3"
      },
      {
       "call": "f0005",
       "line": "- Lantern is an LLM pipeline that extracts structured fields from supplier invoices, and I led it.",
       "turn_id": "r3"
      },
      {
       "call": "f0005",
       "line": "- It cut manual data entry from 11 minutes to 2 minutes per invoice.",
       "turn_id": "r3"
      },
      {
       "call": "d0006",
       "line": "- Lantern is an LLM pipeline that extracts structured fields from supplier invoices, and I led the project. (f006, g003)",
       "turn_id": "r3"
      },
      {
       "call": "d0006",
       "line": "- It cut manual data entry from 11 minutes to 2 minutes per invoice, running on 38,000 invoices a month. (f010, f011)",
       "turn_id": "r3"
      },
      {
       "call": "d0006",
       "line": "- Safeguards: extraction is schema-validated with one retry, then escalated; the model never guesses a total. Fields below 0.8 confidence go to a human. (b003, f014)",
       "turn_id": "r3"
      },
      {
       "call": "d0006",
       "line": "- Held-out accuracy was 96.4 percent for totals and 91 percent for line items. Model cost was about EUR 1,900 a month against EUR 9,500 of labour saved. (f012, f013, f017)",
       "turn_id": "r3"
      }
     ],
